<title>UK: KFW unit sets 500 mln French franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>KFW unit sets 500 mln French franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CDC.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU (RATED AAA/AAA)</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN FFR   COUPON    *4.25	MATURITY    03.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.675   PAY DATE    03.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    100.0     SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (M) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.675</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST FIVE YEARS THEN TEC-10 LINKED +12 BP</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
